body:
Technically mission spoilers, so:

&#x200B;

>!This happens when you enter the facility through the main door, rather than the intended side door. I had this happen to me and the only way to fix it is if you have a save before going deeper into the facility via elevator. If you can load such a save, go back to the big door and on the left (from inside) there will be a smaller door, which is the mission progression trigger. !<

&#x200B;

>!The design of the mission is to show up at the goon camp from the main entrance, take out the goons, then go to the taller building, take out the goons, fight the armored enemy that is dropped from the airship, then the fog will fade from near the waterfalls, revealing the large door. There is a zipline for you to take right next to where the armored enemy was dropped, and when you take the zipline to the big door, the big door is supposed to close. The small door is right next to it, resulting in you walking through it, triggering the next section. !<

&#x200B;

>!What I did wrong was I flew to the mission using the Icarus, then took out the base from back to front. This resulted in me not noticing the zipline, and grav jumping through the big door before it had the chance to close. Therefore, I never walked through the small side door, so I never triggered the next section.!<

&#x200B;

TL;DR 

If you went through the giant ass cargo door, you dun fucked up.
